  {"group":"About us page","key":"about.storyHeading","label":"Story heading","type":"text","default":"From an idea to something you can hold.","maxLength":150},
  {"group":"About us page","key":"about.story1","label":"Story, first paragraph","type":"text","default":"While pursuing her PhD, our founder wondered how else she could contribute to the world. She imagined gifts that make someone feel loved, decorations that brighten a celebration, and keepsakes that hold on to a precious memory. That idea became UDESIGN.","maxLength":800},
  {"group":"About us page","key":"about.story2","label":"Story, second paragraph","type":"text","default":"Today we bring those stories to life through thoughtful design, laser cutting and engraving. From wood and acrylic signage to personalised gifts and cake toppers, each piece is made for a person, a place or a moment worth celebrating.","maxLength":800},
  {"group":"About us page","key":"about.closing","label":"Closing message","type":"text","default":"A little creativity, a little thoughtfulness and a little more love, shared through the things we create.","maxLength":400},
